WEBVTT

00:00:07.928 --> 00:00:08.841
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Who’s that?

00:00:09.956 --> 00:00:11.956
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> That’s my sister, Lena.

00:00:12.522 --> 00:00:13.530
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> How old is she?

00:00:13.717 --> 00:00:15.976
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s 30, look at the cake!

00:00:18.871 --> 00:00:21.213
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Oh yeah! Nice cake!

00:00:21.237 --> 00:00:23.034
Does she also live in the UK?

00:00:23.234 --> 00:00:24.740
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Yes, she does.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:27.426
She lives in London too, quite near me.

00:00:27.933 --> 00:00:31.574
It’s great, because the rest of my family are all in Germany.

00:00:32.938 --> 00:00:33.971
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> What does she do?

00:00:34.404 --> 00:00:35.635
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s a journalist.

00:00:35.815 --> 00:00:36.904
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Oh right.

00:00:36.928 --> 00:00:38.000
Is she married?

00:00:38.485 --> 00:00:40.191
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She has a partner, Sam.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:41.834
He’s English.

00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.306
He works for an IT company.

00:00:45.486 --> 00:00:50.249
And this is my brother Stefan with my nephew, Leon.

00:00:50.507 --> 00:00:52.401
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Ahh! How old is he?

00:00:52.402 --> 00:00:53.040
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Leon?

00:00:54.325 --> 00:00:55.119
About one.

00:00:55.586 --> 00:00:56.740
They live in Berlin –

00:00:58.293 --> 00:01:00.768
I don’t see them very often, unfortunately.

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:03.524
Stefan is a great dad!

00:01:04.444 --> 00:01:05.424
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> So what does he do?

00:01:05.843 --> 00:01:06.663
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> He’s a chef.

00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:13.651
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Is that another sister?

00:01:14.603 --> 00:01:18.489
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> No, that’s my cousin, Nadya, and her husband Alex.

00:01:20.498 --> 00:01:22.649
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> She looks very like Lena!

00:01:24.043 --> 00:01:26.469
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Yes, maybe in that photo!

00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:28.913
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> So what does Nadya do?

00:01:29.139 --> 00:01:30.157
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s a teacher.

00:01:30.505 --> 00:01:32.535
And Alex is a police officer.

00:01:34.162 --> 00:01:36.317
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> They look very young! How old are they?

00:01:36.777 --> 00:01:41.549
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> She’s 24, and he’s 26, I think.

00:01:41.995 --> 00:01:43.488
They live in Frankfurt.

00:01:44.648 --> 00:01:46.176
We’re very good friends.

00:01:47.689 --> 00:01:48.669
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Nice pics!

00:01:49.295 --> 00:01:49.928
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> Thanks.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.469
Can I see some photos of your family?

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:55.503
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Yeah, sure.

00:01:58.210 --> 00:02:00.143
So this is my…

00:02:02.218 --> 00:02:04.164
Sorry, Tanya, I need to go.

00:02:04.165 --> 00:02:06.215
I have a meeting at half past one.

00:02:06.928 --> 00:02:07.600
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> OK.

00:02:07.965 --> 00:02:08.669
<v><b>Alisha:</b></v> Bye.

00:02:08.670 --> 00:02:09.651
<v><b>Tanya:</b></v> See you later.